  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996 people in Varginha, a town in the Brazilian state of Minas Gerais, reported a strange being, and the creature itself became famous across Brazil as the \"Varginha ET\". Aldo Rebelo, a Brazilian politician who served as his country's defense minister, says so in his own words to Michels: \"that event created a celebrity in Brazil.\" To him that fame shows how deeply the case took hold in the country."
